---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import InquiryForm from '../components/InquiryForm.astro';
---
<Layout title="Share a project impact update"><PageIntro eyebrow="For project leaders" title="Help keep the record growing." description="Share a progress update or ask how to submit a project report to the foundation." /><section class="section container two-column"><div class="prose"><h2>Tell us what has changed.</h2><p>Start with your project name, reporting period, the support received, activities completed, outcomes observed, and any challenges or next steps.</p><ul><li>Separate completed results from plans.</li><li>Explain how any numbers were counted.</li><li>Identify which results relate to AEF’s support and which describe the wider project.</li><li>Ask how to share photographs or documents with the right permissions.</li></ul><p class="notice">The original Individual Impact Report page exposes an unavailable legacy form. This replacement prepares an email for you to review and send; it does not claim to submit an official report automatically.</p></div><InquiryForm topic="Project update" /></section></Layout>
